<section id="S3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.3. </span>Tier 3: Codified Context Base (Cold Memory)</h3>

<div id="S3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The knowledge base comprises 34 Markdown files (<math id="S3.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\sim}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∼</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\sim}</annotation></semantics></math>16,250 lines including the <math id="S3.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\sim}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∼</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\sim}</annotation></semantics></math>1,600-line retrieval service), each documenting one subsystem. Three design decisions govern specification authorship: documents are written for AI consumption (explicit code patterns with file paths, parameter names, and expected behavior); specifications are living documents generated and updated by the AI at the developer’s direction; and each document is scoped to a single subsystem to enable targeted retrieval.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Specification format.</span> The following abbreviated example illustrates the structure of a knowledge base document:</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<div id="S3.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F9F9F9;--ltx-border-color:#BFBFBF;"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">#</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">Deterministic</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">RNG</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">Synchronization</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx2" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">##</span><span id="lstnumberx3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">Core</span><span id="lstnumberx3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">Mechanism</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx4" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">CombatRng</span><span id="lstnumberx4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">uses</span><span id="lstnumberx4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">deterministic</span><span id="lstnumberx4.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">hash</span><span id="lstnumberx4.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">:</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx5" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">  </span><span id="lstnumberx5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">hash</span><span id="lstnumberx5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">seed</span><span id="lstnumberx5.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx5.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx5.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">playerId</span><span id="lstnumberx5.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx5.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx5.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">shotCounter</span><span id="lstnumberx5.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">)</span><span id="lstnumberx5.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx5.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">-&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx5.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx5.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">float</span><span id="lstnumberx5.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx5.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">[0,1)</span>
</div>
