<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Example Agent Specification</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following is an abbreviated specification for the <span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">coordinate<span id="A2.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">-</span>wizard</span> agent, a read-only diagnostic agent for coordinate transform debugging.</p>
